    {"type": "text", "id": "input_box_text", "x": 36, "y": 278, "width": 375, "height": 147, "text": "# INPUT PACKAGE\nEverything needed is in this one file.\n## Job\nTitle: Graduate Software Engineer\n- Solid understanding of testing, Git and Docker\n## Master CV paragraphs\ndocument:p0004 [E] Computer Science graduate…\ndocument:p0009 [L] Inventory Tracker…\ndocument:p0010 [Eb] Built a REST API for…", "originalText": "# INPUT PACKAGE\nEverything needed is in this one file.\n## Job\nTitle: Graduate Software Engineer\n- Solid understanding of testing, Git and Docker\n## Master CV paragraphs\ndocument:p0004 [E] Computer Science graduate…\ndocument:p0009 [L] Inventory Tracker…\ndocument:p0010 [Eb] Built a REST API for…", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300012, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300013, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},

